{"articleNo":"94287","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=94287&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[취업지원본부-마감] 취업역량강화를 위한 MOS Master 자격증 과정 참여인원 마감","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.11.04","hit":"3203","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>취업역량강화를 위한 MOS Master 자격증 과정 참여인원</strong> </span></span></font><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\" color=\"#ff007f\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\">마감</span></strong></font></p><p><font color=\"#ff007f\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span></strong></font>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">MOS Master과정에 많은 신청 감사드리며, </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">신청인원이 정원의&nbsp;2배를 초과하여, 모집을 마감합니다.</font></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\"></font></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">선정인원 및 후보자는 오늘 오후 홈페이지를 통해 공지하도록 하겠습니다.</font></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\"></font></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">감사합니다.</font></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\"></font></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">* 문의처 취업지원본부 최동호&nbsp; 054-478-7984</font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
